<div class="document-description">
This plan--though specific to the District of Columbia--can serve as a mode for others interested in planning to establish a Family Assistance Center after a mass fatality event to provide services to those seeking assistance regarding the status of their loved ones.</div>

      <div class="document-login-link"><a href="/login?returnurl=jD1jvaFhXKkUAJiObLAnHQhR&#x2B;ZlMcKceJc00cxX7s9yd2wdazhcOQbuKj0ulEVvKSp2vGMFUwiyUGkMlooZd7HV1M8A3CXMTd5B/q4f2yHQH5j3c/DRDNT36pxqwPxGn">Login</a> to favorite the article</div>

