<div class="document-indent">
<div class="document-title">
Region V for Kids. (n.d.).    
        <a href="https://www.regionvforkids.org/family-reunification?cb=13105" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">
            <strong>Family Reunification Learning Modules.</strong>
        </a>

(Accessed 11/14/2025.)     
</div>
<div class="document-description">
This free 5-module curriculum covers the essential elements of a hospital family reunification plan; facility logistics; information sharing, security concerns, and legal considerations; plan activation and exercising family reunification plans; and demobilization, after-action reports, and recovery.</div>

